senses.gloss:
उत्कंठते Den. A.
1 To be anxious.
pine or be sorry for; Ś. 4;
Śi. 9. 54.
--2 To yearn, be eagerly
desirous of (with gen. or dat.);
स्वर्गाय नोत्कंठते V. 3. 4; Mv. 6; उत्कंठते
च युष्मत्सन्निकर्षस्य U. 6, 6. 21;
Māl. 4; Bk. 5. 72. --Caus. (
उत्कठयति) To create anxiety or longing,
inspire with tender emotions;
Bh. 1. 35; Ghaṭ. 5.

उत्कूलित a. Brought to the bank
or shore, reaching the bank;
प्रतिक्षणोत्कूलितशेवलाभाः Śi. 3. 70.
